  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pakistan Legislative, Electoral, Digital Governance and Enpowerment (PLEDGE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is designed to provide technical assistance to Election Commission of Pakistan (ECP), with a focus on promoting more inclusive, credible, and accountable electoral processes. Building on lessons learnt and insights from UNDP&#x2019;s support to the previous electoral cycles in Pakistan from 2012 to 2024, this initiative is a direct response to the Government of Pakistans request for continued electoral support. It is aligned with the recommendations outlined in key election reports, includ</narrative>
  </description>
